{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, אנתה","hw":"אנתה","html":"‡ <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אנתה</span></big></big>  Kt<sub>14</sub> (i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְתָּה</span>, peculiar to Biblical Aramaic; Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְתְּ</span>) <strong>pr. 2 ms. thou (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּה</span> p. 61b; Cappad. and Egyptian Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אנת</span> (Lzb<sup>Eph. i. 67</sup>; S-C<sup> A 11 +</sup>, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">אנתי</span> <em>ib.</em> <sup>D 9, 11, 26 +</sup>), Nerab <span dir=\"rtl\">את</span> (Cooke <sup>186. 190</sup>), Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">אנת</span> (<em>ib.</em> <sup>308</sup>); 𝔗<sup>O</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">את</span>, 𝔗<sup>J</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">אנת</span> (D<sup>§ 16. 1</sup>); Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܝ݈ܬ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<em>thou</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:29\" href=\"/Daniel.2.29\">Dn 2:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:31\" href=\"/Daniel.2.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:37\" href=\"/Daniel.2.37\">37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:38\" href=\"/Daniel.2.38\">38</a> etc., <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:25\" href=\"/Ezra.7.25\">Ezr 7:25</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, אַנְתּוּן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נְשִׁין"}